<section class="mod">
<div class="chrow" id="ch-3" data-ch="3"><span class="chn">03</span><span class="chname">Problem</span></div>
<div class="stmtBlock">
<h2 class="t2 sm"><span>The</span><span class="g">Problem</span></h2>
<p class="stmt">When a recharge fails or money goes to the wrong plan, customers open the in-app support chat at a stressful moment. A bot that misreads the question, asks for details the app already has, or answers every mood in the same flat tone turns a quick fix into <b>a loop of typing and repeating</b> <span class="chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9a5 5 0 0 1 9-2M17 15a5 5 0 0 1-9 2" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 3v4h-4M8 21v-4h4" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></span>. What is missing is a bot that understands <b class="gt">both the problem and the person</b> <span class="chip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3.4" fill="#fff"/><path d="M5.5 19c1-3.4 3.6-5 6.5-5s5.5 1.6 6.5 5" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
